  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Education Pool Fund</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNDP is administering the Education Pool Fund.The EPF is a joint donor funding modality for the purpose to find a flexible funding mechanism for studies and activities important for the development of the education sector and the implementation of ESDP,. The EPF finance Annual Review Meeting. Joint Review Mission, studies, reviews, pieces of research as basis of dialogue between partners in the sector.</narrative>
